## Interface: 16001
## Title: LibMonetColor-1.0
## Notes: Monet-style adaptive environment colour engine. Derives an adaptive "5+3" theme (edge glow / ambient tint / highlight wash + Monet neutral) from the player's current zone, plus an optional state layer that tints any UI with the player's combat / rest / health state.
## Author: EastHillGu
## Version: 1.2.0
## X-Category: Library
## X-Website: https://github.com/easthillgu/monetcolors
## OptionalDeps: CallbackHandler-1.0
## LoadOnDemand: 1

# LibStub is embedded (Public Domain) so this library needs no external addon.
# Same file as MonetUI/Libs/LibStub/LibStub.lua.
Libs\LibStub\LibStub.lua

# Core engine
LibMonetColor-1.0.lua

# Optional zone environment data (mapID -> HSL); the engine finds it lazily.
MonetColorMapData-1.0.lua

# Player-state colour layer + shared pulse ticker.
# Depends on the core engine above, so it must be loaded after it.
# Consumers that only want the environment colours can leave it out.
LibMonetColor-Anim-1.0.lua
